pload Custom Background\n\nRecommended: 1080 × 1920 portrait. PNG, JPG or WebP, up to 12 MB. Uploads are optimized before saving. Three custom designs per branch.\n\nRefresh available designs\nDefault\nActive\nSelected\nRoyal Indian Dining\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nModern Indian Dining\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nGujarati Thali\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nNorth Indian Cuisine\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nSouth Indian Cuisine\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nIndian Street Food\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nPremium Biryani\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nVegetarian Garden\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nCafé & Casual Dining\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nHeritage Sweets\n\nIndian Dining\n\nPreview\nDefault\nMidnight Spice\n\nDark & Dramatic\n\nPreview\nDefault\nTerracotta Table\n\nRustic & Earthy\n\nPreview\nDefault\nTeal Pop Kitchen\n\nModern & Playful\n\nPreview\nDefault\nBotanical Bistro\n\nBotanical & Fresh\n\nPreview\nDefault\nPastel Patisserie\n\nCafé & Pastel\n\nPreview\nDefault\nUrban Street Kitchen\n\nBold & Urban\n\nPreview\nKiosk Preview\nSaved configuration\nPortrait\nLandscape\n768 × 1024\n800 × 1280\n820 × 1180\n1024 × 768\n1280 × 800\n1366 × 768\n1920 × 1080\nFreshly prepared · Served with care\n\nWelcome to\n\nUI Audit Restaurant A\n\nAuthentic Flavors, Seamless Dining\n\nStart Order\n\nTouch screen to begin your order\n\nSame renderer as the customer kiosk · English preview · 800 × 1280\n\nImage fit & position\nFit\nFill screen · Cover\nShow full photo · Soft backdrop\nHorizontal position · 50\nVertical position · 50\nZoom · 1\nReadability overlay · 0.2\nConfiguration delivery\n\nVersion: 2026-10-13T15:37:54.738Z\n\nPublished configuration\n\nOnline kiosks receive configuration events. Offline kiosks keep their last saved design and catch up after reconnecting.\n\nJAMAN AI",
